abstract: >-
  A small Python and SQLite reference prototype of a governance workflow for
  community-led cultural and spatial-media projects. It encodes gates for
  contributor consent (expiry, withdrawal, prohibited uses), a registered
  Indigenous governance authority for Indigenous material, public-display
  permission, required accessibility features, payment before publication,
  incident reporting, an append-only audit log and an impact-report export.
  It also generates a starting community plan for any city, in Python and in a
  static English/French web page, without naming Indigenous nations or adding
  local statistics.
  Dual-licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0. Not legal advice and not a production
  system. No endorsement by, or consultation with, any Wolastoqey community or
  other community is claimed; names in the demo are placeholders.
